id: pm-evidence-sdk-adoption-1025
title: Use the pm SDK for evidence token accounting and output budgets
description: "Replace both unused SDK findings from the 2026-10-25 audit in src/core.ts. Preserve JSON/TOON newline-aware token counts, prefix selection, source completeness and traversal receipts. Prove parity on public tracker copies, per-function revert checks, history integrity after cache priming, and unchanged full release gates."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[2]: audit-1025,sdk-adoption
created_at: "2026-10-25T17:29:16.648Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T03:18:07.863Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-26T03:17:52.851Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-25T17:49:48.000Z"
author: codex-agent
resolution: "Delivered by PR #5, merge 4e8bee4218e022d1a9d45fe4fbecb5b635a0b52d, merged 2026-10-25T17:49:48Z. src/core.ts delegates paired JSON/TOON newline token estimates to estimatePmOutputTokens and omission materiality to createOutputOmissionReceipt. src/store.ts independently verifies authoritative history before mutation. test/sdk-adoption.test.ts covers exact budgets, prefix/source/traversal receipts and cache-primed corruption. docs/sdk-adoption-1025.md distinguishes two structural delegation controls from the behavioural integrity revert."
expected_result: "SDK token and omission accounting preserve exact output/budget behavior and source receipts, with fresh corruption refusal."
actual_result: "Six focused regressions pass. Existing paired-renderer lossless-prefix selection remains package policy because the SDK lacks an equivalent final-envelope estimator; no complete prefix-policy migration, atomic history fence or remote backend conformance is claimed."
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T17:29:18.821Z",codex-agent,"Search found no existing SDK-adoption item. Related SDK boundary: pm-evidence-backend-conformance remains open for remote atomic mutations; this adoption changes only output accounting and projection, retaining commitItemMutations and certified reads. SDK stays pinned at 2026.10.23; current registry CLI is 2026.10.25."
  "2026-10-25T17:30:31.779Z",codex-agent,"Finding src/core.ts:21: replace byte-to-token arithmetic with estimatePmOutputTokens on max(JSON UTF-8 bytes plus newline, TOON UTF-8 bytes plus newline). Finding src/core.ts:25-33: adopt createOutputOmissionReceipt for output omission materiality; retain package counts and sourceComplete/traversal semantics. Cannot replace prefix-budget policy with applyReadOutputDimensions in pinned SDK 2026.10.23: resolveReadOutputDimensions returns undefined for evidence check and extension:evidence, so helper returns input unchanged. Built-in list budgeting uses one rendering, adds its own envelope, and may compact strings. Missing SDK API: extension-surface registration plus caller-supplied final-envelope estimator and lossless ordered-prefix-only budget selection. No dependency bump or fabricated transaction API. Pure equivalent estimator/receipt delegation cannot have a behavioral revert failure without an intentional behavior change; record structural delegation revert controls separately from behavioral parity and integrity regressions."
  "2026-10-25T17:34:41.522Z",codex-agent,"Differential: compiled origin/main 603e57d versus candidate, no-git public tracker copies, PATH without git. pm-evidence head 603e57d: 10 items, 165 identical comparisons, 26 source files unchanged. pm-changelog head fa8a8a1: 197 items, 189 identical comparisons, 404 source files unchanged. Total 354 identical outputs/refusals; no output differences. Packet cases use real item metadata; public trackers have no stored citations. Intentional new refusal: corrupt authoritative history now fails SDK verification before evidence mutation. The SDK transaction previously accepted a corrupted record hash even after priming listMutationEvents. Preflight is independent of event caches but does not claim atomic fencing against concurrent external tampering; missing SDK API: verified-history transaction precondition in commitItemMutations. Existing backend-conformance item retains remote-write boundary."
  "2026-10-25T17:34:42.302Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof for token replacement: node test/sdk-revert.acceptance.ts restores only tokens from origin/main; delegation regression fails exactly 1, then source restored. This is structural, not behavioral: arithmetic is exactly equivalent. Revert proof for omission replacement: restores only packet from origin/main; delegation regression fails exactly 1, then source restored. Also structural because outputs are identical. Behavioral revert proof: remove only the independent history verification from Store.commit; cache-primed corruption regression fails exactly 1 (write accepted); original source restored. Positive targeted tests: 6 pass, 0 fail; typecheck and lint pass."
  "2026-10-25T17:36:44.441Z",codex-agent,"Correction to the projection gap: SDK host registration via CommandDefinition.read_output exists. It is NOT a missing SDK API. Standalone evidence calls currently have no active declaration, so the direct projection probe returns input unchanged. The actual blocker is a caller-supplied final-envelope estimator with lossless prefix-only selection: SDK budgeting measures one rendering and may compact strings; host registration cannot preserve evidence paired-renderer/newline/self-accounting boundaries. check also mutates last-check observations by default, so it is not a read-only handler. docs/sdk-adoption-1025.md records this corrected scope. No upstream issue filed."
  "2026-10-25T17:36:45.960Z",codex-agent,"Local clean-home health passed; ordinary host health reports only a global pm-github extension host-version skew (pinned host 2026.10.23 versus global extension 2026.10.25), absent from isolated CI identity. Initial release gate caught a 3-line test harness clone; removed duplication without lowering the 0% threshold."
  "2026-10-25T17:39:25.056Z",codex-agent,"Local full gates passed with isolated HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1: npm run release:check and bun run release:check. Each: 89 tests passed, 0 failed/skipped/canceled; 2 packed npm/npx and bun/bunx journeys passed. Coverage 100/100/100/100 across 19 source files (1174 statements/lines, 74 functions, 623 branches); duplication 0%; typecheck, lint, docstrings, production audit, package allowlist, changelog and publish-attestation checks passed. Linked pm test run: 6 passed; result tracking disabled by existing policy, so receipt is recorded here. Source delta replaces 2 hand-written output lines; git source diff deletes 3 lines including the expanded SDK import. No thresholds or dependency pins changed. Ready for PR and CI verification; keep item in progress for orchestrator closeout."
  "2026-10-25T17:40:27.439Z",codex-agent,"Review handoff: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-evidence/pull/5 (ready, not draft). Code and tracker evidence committed as 7c5a8ea. CI started at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-evidence/actions/runs/40217554699; final handoff commit will trigger exact-head CI, whose URL and counts are maintained in the PR. Both local full gates passed (89 unit tests plus 2 packed journeys each). SDK gaps and structural-versus-behavioral revert boundaries are explicitly documented. Releasing claim without closing; orchestrator owns verification and closeout. No merge, release, dependency bump or upstream issue filing."
  "2026-10-25T17:41:24.508Z",codex-agent,"CI 40217554699 failed at clean-checkout typecheck on both Node versions: the differential worker imported absent dist declarations before the build step. Local release checks had a prior dist build. Reclaimed the item to fix test harness imports: checked-in worker will import source for clean typechecking, while disposable workers are rewritten to the baseline/candidate compiled builds during the differential run. Production implementation unchanged."
  "2026-10-25T17:44:22.806Z",codex-agent,"Clean-checkout harness correction verified: npm run typecheck passes with dist temporarily absent; lint and duplication pass; compiled differential rerun still gives 354 identical comparisons and 430 unchanged public source files. Both isolated npm run release:check and bun run release:check reruns passed: each 89 tests plus 2 packed journeys, zero failures/skips, 100/100/100/100 coverage across 19 source files, duplication 0%. Ready for exact-head CI retry on PR 5. Releasing claim again; keep item in progress for orchestrator verification. Production output and integrity implementation unchanged by this harness correction."
  "2026-10-26T03:13:39.643Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit on main 4e8bee4218e022d1a9d45fe4fbecb5b635a0b52d: merged PR #5 (4e8bee4218e022d1a9d45fe4fbecb5b635a0b52d, merged 2026-10-25T17:49:48Z). src/core.ts delegates paired JSON/TOON newline token estimates to estimatePmOutputTokens and omission materiality to createOutputOmissionReceipt. src/store.ts independently verifies authoritative history before mutation. test/sdk-adoption.test.ts covers exact budgets, prefix/source/traversal receipts and cache-primed corruption. docs/sdk-adoption-1025.md distinguishes two structural delegation controls from the behavioural integrity revert. All scoped acceptance criteria are represented by the inspected implementation and regressions. Existing behavioural revert evidence is retained; this tracker-only audit changes no runtime functions."
